  "notes": [
    "2023 IT-215 instructions use the official annual HTML original because the annual PDF path returned 404.",
    "NY IT-209 columns a/b/c are independently compared cell by cell and at every partial-interval footnote to the installed federal exact tables before sharing their lookup implementation. Annual NY comparison thresholds remain distinct.",
    "External OTDA eligibility verification is required by New York; this local calculation does not provide it.",
    "Annual one-half-year order language does not establish a universal day-count rule. 181\u2013183-day periods remain unknown. Official OTDA06-ADM-12-T Attachment5 search evidence says six months; direct downloads returned502/connection reset, so no byte pin is claimed for that supporting research."
  ],
  "supportingResearch": [
